/* 基础样式 */
.sentence-item {
 margin-bottom: 12px;
 margin-left: 6px;
 cursor: pointer;
 line-height: 1.6;
}
.sentence-number {
 font-weight: bold;
 color: #2c3e50; 
 user-select: none; 
 padding: 2px 4px;
 border-radius: 2px;
}
.sentence-number:hover {
 background-color: #f5f7fa; 
}
.cn-sentence {
 margin-left: 4px;
}
.en-sentence {
 display: none;
 margin-left: 42px; 
 color: #666; 
 margin-top: 4px;
}
.sentence-item.active .en-sentence {
 display: block;
}
.study-title {
 font-size: 18px;
 font-weight: bold;
 color: var(--color-title);
 margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
 border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
 padding-bottom: 5px;
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-list"&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;一. anger相关&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;01&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他的话里充满了愤怒。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;There was much anger in his words.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;02&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 她试图掩饰自己的愤怒。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;She tried to hide her anger.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;二. rage相关&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;03&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他的暴怒让周围的人害怕。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;His rage frightened the people around him.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;04&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 她在暴怒中摔碎了花瓶。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;She smashed the vase in a rage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;三. madness相关&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;05&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 战争的残酷会带来疯狂。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;The cruelty of war can bring madness.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;06&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他在疯狂中做出了错误决定。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;He made a wrong decision in madness.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;四. fury相关&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;07&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他的眼睛里闪烁着狂怒。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;There was fury in his eyes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;08&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 敌人的攻击激起了我们的狂怒。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;The enemy's attack aroused our fury.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;五. angry相关&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;09&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他因为迟到而生气。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;He is angry because he is late.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 妈妈生气地看着调皮的孩子。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Mother looked at the naughty child angrily.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;六. annoyed相关&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他对持续的噪音感到气恼。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;He is annoyed by the continuous noise.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 她因被误解而气恼不已。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;She is extremely annoyed by being misunderstood.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;七. enraged相关&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;13&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 不公平的对待让他暴怒。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;He was enraged by the unfair treatment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;14&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 看到破坏的场景他暴怒起来。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;He became enraged when seeing the scene of destruction.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;八. irritated相关&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 频繁的打扰让他恼怒。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;He is irritated by the frequent interruptions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;16&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 她因计划被打乱而恼怒。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;She is irritated because the plan is disrupted.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;九. mad相关&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;17&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他在堵车时抓狂得大喊。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;He shouted madly during the traffic jam.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;18&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 考试失败让他抓狂。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;He went mad because of failing the exam.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="study-title"&gt;十. furious相关&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;19&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他对这个结果狂怒不已。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;He is furious about the result.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 她因被欺骗而狂怒。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;She is furious because she is deceived.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script&gt;
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
 const sentenceItems = document.querySelectorAll('.sentence-item');
 sentenceItems.forEach(item =&gt; {
 const numberElement = item.querySelector('.sentence-number');
 numberElement.addEventListener('click', function() {
 item.classList.toggle('active');
 });
 item.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
 if (e.target !== numberElement) {
 item.classList.toggle('active');
 }
 });
 });
});
&lt;/script&gt;</description></item><item><title>续写情绪之焦虑</title><link>https://nzw025.top/jingxinyanxue/xiezuo/concern/</link><pubDate>Sun, 15 Feb 2026 18:13:27 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://nzw025.top/jingxinyanxue/xiezuo/concern/</guid><description>&lt;style&gt;
/* 基础样式 */
.sentence-item {
 margin-bottom: 12px;
 margin-left: 6px;
 cursor: pointer;
 line-height: 1.6;
}
.sentence-number {
 font-weight: bold;
 color: #2c3e50; 
 user-select: none; 
 padding: 2px 4px;
 border-radius: 2px;
}
.sentence-number:hover {
 background-color: #f5f7fa; 
}
.cn-sentence {
 margin-left: 4px;
}
.en-sentence {
 display: none;
 margin-left: 42px; 
 color: #666; 
 margin-top: 4px;
}
.sentence-item.active .en-sentence {
 display: block;
}
.study-title {
 font-size: 18px;
 font-weight: bold;
 color: var(--color-title);
 margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
 border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
 padding-bottom: 5px;
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-list"&gt;
&lt;div class="category-title"&gt;一. 担忧 (concern)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;01&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 我们对环境的担忧与日俱增。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Our concern about the environment is growing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;02&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 她的担忧在眼神中清晰可见。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Her concern is clearly visible in her eyes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="category-title"&gt;二. 焦虑 (anxiety)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;03&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他的焦虑源于工作压力。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;His anxiety comes from work pressure.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;04&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 考试前的焦虑让他难以入眠。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Anxiety before the exam makes it hard for him to sleep.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="category-title"&gt;三. 忧虑 (agitation)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;05&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 她脸上的忧虑无法消散。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;The agitation on her face won't disappear.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;06&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他带着忧虑处理棘手问题。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;He deals with the tough problem with agitation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="category-title"&gt;四. 担忧的 (concerned)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;07&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 那位担忧的父亲四处寻找孩子。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;The concerned father is looking for his child everywhere.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;08&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 担忧的医生密切关注病人。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;The concerned doctor pays close attention to the patient.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="category-title"&gt;五. 焦虑的 (anxious)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/br&gt; 
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;09&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 焦虑的投资者等待着股市消息。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Anxious investors are waiting for stock market news.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 焦虑的心情让他坐立不安。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;The anxious mood makes him restless.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="category-title"&gt;六. 焦虑不安的 (agitated)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 焦虑不安的人群呼喊着口号。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;The agitated crowd shouts slogans.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他焦虑不安的状态很明显。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;His agitated state is very obvious.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="category-title"&gt;七. 坐立不安的 (restless)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;13&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 坐立不安的他在房间里走来走去。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Restless, he walks around in the room.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;14&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 坐立不安的思绪困扰着他。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Restless thoughts trouble him.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="category-title"&gt;八. 紧张的 (nervous)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 紧张的运动员做着深呼吸。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;The nervous athlete takes deep breaths.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;16&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 她紧张的样子让人有些心疼。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;Her nervous look makes people feel a bit sorry.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="category-title"&gt;九. 颤抖 (shake)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;17&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他冷得直颤抖，赶紧穿上外套。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;He shakes with cold and quickly puts on a coat.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;18&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 地震时大地颤抖，房屋晃动。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;The earth shakes during the earthquake and houses sway.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="category-title"&gt;十. 忧虑 (agitation)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;19&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 她脸上的忧虑无法消散。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;The agitation on her face won't disappear.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="sentence-item"&gt;
 &lt;span class="sentence-number"&gt;20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cn-sentence"&gt;. 他带着忧虑处理棘手问题。&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;div class="en-sentence"&gt;He deals with the tough problem with agitation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script&gt;
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
 const sentenceItems = document.querySelectorAll('.sentence-item');
 sentenceItems.forEach(item =&gt; {
 const numberElement = item.querySelector('.sentence-number');
 numberElement.addEventListener('click', function() {
 item.classList.toggle('active');
 });
 item.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
 if (e.target !== numberElement) {
 item.classList.toggle('active');
 }
 });
 });
});
&lt;/script&gt;</description></item><item><title>平安喜乐 得偿所愿</title><link>https://nzw025.top/qianxushiguang/yinhua/paxl/</link><pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2025 21:03:27 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://nzw025.top/qianxushiguang/yinhua/paxl/</guid><description>&lt;!-- 核心修复：删除多余的 HTML 骨架（Hugo 会自动生成 html/head/body） --&gt;
